# Dockerfile-specific ignore rules apply to the repository-root build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.runtime
**/data
**/logs
**/coverage
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.worktrees
frontend/src
frontend/tests
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
